## Abstract
Example Protocol is an automated market maker with a single vault contract per network.

## Token

Total supply: 1,000,000,000 EXP tokens, fixed at genesis. Decimals: 18.

## Fees

A swap fee of 0.3% is charged on every trade and sent to the treasury.

## Governance

Ownership of the vault contract has been renounced; no admin can pause or upgrade it.

## Networks

The protocol is live on Ethereum, Base and Arbitrum.
